<title>USA: Youth Services Q4 net loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Youth Services Q4 net loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>OWINGS MILLS, Md. 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr pri loss    $0.02	   profit $0.10</p>
<p> Shr dil profit  0.01		     n/a</p>
<p> Net loss	  238	     profit 860</p>
<p> Revs		22,946		   15,409</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary9,794		    8,319</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted12,901		   n/a</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr pri profit  $0.25	    profit$0.26</p>
<p> Shr dil profit  0.26		     n/a</p>
<p> Net profit	2,271	    profit2,179</p>
