<p> Avg shrs diluted10,936		   n/a</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Youth Services International Inc.</p>
<p>Results are for quarter and 12 months ended June 30.</p>
<p>The company said the current quarter's net income was hurt by exercising an option to acquire Introspect HealthCare Corp.</p>
<p>Current quarter net results also included non-recurring costs related to the uncompleted acquistion of Three Springs Inc and non-recurring costs from the early conversion of certain debentures.</p>
